{"id":"c565648eb47244b6","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-zfc-forcing11-boolean-completion-map.md","title":"ZFC Forcing11 Boolean Completion Map","display":"df-zfc-forcing11-boolean-completion-map — ZFC Forcing11 Boolean Completion Map","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing11-boolean-completion-map","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing11-boolean-completion-map"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing11-boolean-completion-map — ZFC Forcing11 Boolean Completion Map","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-complete-boolean-algebra.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing11-boolean-completion-map"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing11-boolean-completion-map</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing11-boolean-completion-map — ZFC Forcing11 Boolean Completion Map"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4e2f094f20e94aa6\" href=\"?note=4e2f094f20e94aa6\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-zfc-complete-boolean-algebra.md\">../batch17/58-df-zfc-complete-boolean-algebra.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b,P,\\leq_P,B,\\wedge_B,\\vee_B,\\neg_B,0_B,1_B\\in V\">\\(b,P,\\leq_P,B,\\wedge_B,\\vee_B,\\neg_B,0_B,1_B\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\)</span> (poset predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S\\)</span> (complete-Boolean-algebra predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4e2f094f20e94aa6\" href=\"?note=4e2f094f20e94aa6\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-zfc-complete-boolean-algebra.md\">../batch17/58-df-zfc-complete-boolean-algebra.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing11BooleanCompletionMap}_S\\subseteq V^9\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing11BooleanCompletionMap}_S\\subseteq V^9\\)</span> (structure-relative predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing11\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}completion\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing11BooleanCompletionMap}_S(b,P,\\leq_P,B,\\wedge_B,\\vee_B,\\neg_B,0_B,1_B)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{CompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S(B,\\wedge_B,\\vee_B,\\neg_B,0_B,1_B)\\land b:P\\to B\\setminus\\{0_B\\}\\land\\forall p,q\\in P\\;\\bigl(\\langle p,q\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\\leftrightarrow b(p)\\wedge_B b(q)=b(p)\\bigr)\\land\\forall c\\in B\\setminus\\{0_B\\}\\;\\exists p\\in P\\;(b(p)\\wedge_B c=b(p))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing11\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}completion\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing11BooleanCompletionMap}_S(b,P,\\leq_P,B,\\wedge_B,\\vee_B,\\neg_B,0_B,1_B)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{CompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S(B,\\wedge_B,\\vee_B,\\neg_B,0_B,1_B)\\land b:P\\to B\\setminus\\{0_B\\}\\land\\forall p,q\\in P\\;\\bigl(\\langle p,q\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\\leftrightarrow b(p)\\wedge_B b(q)=b(p)\\bigr)\\land\\forall c\\in B\\setminus\\{0_B\\}\\;\\exists p\\in P\\;(b(p)\\wedge_B c=b(p))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The complete Boolean algebra is now supplied with its operations, and its order is expanded as <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\wedge_Bv=u\">\\(u\\wedge_Bv=u\\)</span> instead of using an undeclared <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_B\">\\(\\leq_B\\)</span> relation.</li>\n<li>All Boolean operations and constants are predicate arguments, and the forcing order is tested by relation membership.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-zfc-complete-boolean-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"4e2f094f20e94aa6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-complete-boolean-algebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}$ (poset predicate, see [[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-zfc-complete-boolean-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"4e2f094f20e94aa6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S$ (c